Wiki_Shortcuts_Content:
Here are some useful shortcuts every viceroy should know. Keybinds can be changed in the options menu.

<b>Visual overlays:</b>
 - Workplace highlight - hold {0}
 - Resource highlight - hold {1}
 - Recipe highlight - hold {2}
 - Blightrot highlight - hold {3}

<b>Buildings/construction:</b>
 - Continuous construction - hold {4}
 - Move building - {5} 
 - Move to next building of same type - {6}
 - Move to previous building of same type - {7}

<b>UI Panels:</b>
 - Recipes - {8}
 - Orders - {9}
 - Trade Routes - {10}
